{"availability":"available","full":"EmenstaNougat/BlueJammer-V2","name":"BlueJammer-V2","description":"BlueJammer-V2 is a two-board RF research platform combining an ESP32 jamming engine with a BW16 5GHz web controller. Features up to 4x NRF24L01 modules, live OLED display, real-time web interface and full UART communication between both boards. Educational purposes only!","category":"Education","language":"Batchfile","stars":280,"forks":26,"created":"2026-03-17T21:52:43Z","updated":"2026-09-12T01:33:47Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://emensta.pages.dev","topics":["2-4ghz","ble","bluetooth","bw16","educational","esp32","jamming","nrf24l01","oled","rc","research","rf","rtl8720dn","wifi"],"demo":"https://emensta.pages.dev/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:03.770Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:03.770Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:58:03.770Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T08:58:03.770Z","stars":280,"forks":26}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Jamming is ILLEGAL! Educational purposes only!","BlueJammer-V2 is a two-board RF research platform built around the ESP32-WROOM-32U and the Ai-Thinker BW16 (RTL8720DN). It is the direct successor to the original ESP32-BlueJammer, bringing a completely reworked architecture, a live 5GHz web interface, a 128x64 OLED display, a quad NRF24L01 jamming engine, and a robust UART communication layer between both boards.","This project is closed source and provided as pre-compiled firmware only. The source code is not publicly available. If you purchased this device from anyone other than official sources at emensta.pages.dev - you have been scammed."],"features":["Up to 4x NRF24L01+ modules running simultaneously in a dynamic round-robin hop pattern","Modules are hot-pluggable - the probe task detects connect/disconnect every 500ms and redistributes hops automatically so 1, 2, 3, or 4 radios always run at full capacity","Mode 1 - Bluetooth (2.4GHz, C